  "description": {
    "lead": "Would you like to play something with tough puzzles and laughing-out-loud humour? What about something full of funny characters, featuring mind-bending plots and brain-teasing puzzles?\n\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nHelp the King regain his sanity after he got turned into a raving lunatic, save the kidnapped prince and interview Queen Xina and King Bodd who have been fighting for years.\n\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nYou will be confronted by surprise after surprise and will have to face the most unexpected enemies.\nEnjoy good, old-fashioned fun for everyone.\n\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIncludes Gobliiins, Gobliins 2: Prince Buffoon, and Goblins Quest 3; you can choose between floppy and CD\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMind-boggling puzzles in a crazy, surreal world full of even crazier characters\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFirst class witty dialog and slapstick humor\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ul\u003E",
    "full": "Would you like to play something with tough puzzles and laughing-out-loud humour? What about something full of funny characters, featuring mind-bending plots and brain-teasing puzzles?\n\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nHelp the King regain his sanity after he got turned into a raving lunatic, save the kidnapped prince and interview Queen Xina and King Bodd who have been fighting for years.\n\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nYou will be confronted by surprise after surprise and will have to face the most unexpected enemies.\nEnjoy good, old-fashioned fun for everyone.\n\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIncludes Gobliiins, Gobliins 2: Prince Buffoon, and Goblins Quest 3; you can choose between floppy and CD\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMind-boggling puzzles in a crazy, surreal world full of even crazier characters\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFirst class witty dialog and slapstick humor\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ul\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIncludes Gobliiins, Gobliins 2: Prince Buffoon, and Goblins Quest 3; you can choose between floppy and CD\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EMind-boggling puzzles in a crazy, surreal world full of even crazier characters\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EFirst class witty dialog and slapstick humor\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ul\u003E",
    "whats_cool_about_it": "Includes Gobliiins, Gobliins 2: Prince Buffoon, and Goblins Quest 3; you can choose between floppy and CD\n\u003Cbr\u003EMind-boggling puzzles in a crazy, surreal world full of even crazier characters\n\u003Cbr\u003EFirst class witty dialog and slapstick humor"
  },
